OL,5,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe second visit is to the
OL,7,     Fclothes-free Clover Spa and Hotel
OL,8,     Fin Birmingham, where owner Tim
OL,9,     FHiggs plans to convert his rivals
OL,10,     Fto the joys of naturism.
OL,11,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FMark Davidson and Layla Caton are
OL,13,     Fdetermined to deliver a heavenly
OL,14,     Fstay at The Angel Hotel in
OL,15,     FColeford, Gloucestershire. But
OL,16,     Fmanners slip over dinner and
OL,17,     Fthere's confusion at breakfast.
