OL,12,     FYeovil. Business owner and
OL,13,     Fmuscleman Alan hopes to create a
OL,14,     FZen evening. But with rotten
OL,15,     Fbeans, tofu cheesecake and soggy
OL,16,     Fnoodles on the menu, it could be a
OL,17,     Frecipe for disaster... (Ep4/5)
